<div class="page-head">
  <h1 class="page-title"><span class="page-title-mark">#</span> 搜索</h1>
  <p class="page-desc">在标题、标签和摘要里找</p>
</div>

<div class="search-page">
  <div class="search-input-wrap search-input-wrap-page">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-search"></use></svg>
    <input id="search-page-input" type="search" placeholder="输入关键词，比如「Markdown」" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" autofocus>
  </div>
  <div id="search-page-results" class="search-results">
    <p class="search-hint">输入关键词开始搜索，也可以随时按 <kbd>/</kbd> 唤起搜索框。</p>
  </div>
</div>
